.el .ds Aq '
.TH tine-export 1  "export " 
.SH NAME
tine\-export \- Export public pages from a graph
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine export\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export public pages from a graph
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
tine\-export\-static(1)
Write the static HTML site
.TP
tine\-export\-live(1)
Write the read\-only Tine app, with the static site as its fallback
